{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Pr9MVp0EFH1792731956.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受能源價格高企及日圓疲弱令進口成本上升，日本上月通脹高於市場預期。</p><p></p><p>日本政府公布上月消費物價指數按年升幅擴大0.2個百分點，至百分之2.1。撇除生鮮食品及能源的全國核心消費物價指數按年升百分之2.4，高於市場預期。當中新鮮食材上升百分之2.1，家用物品升幅擴大至百分之6.5，教育下跌百分之3.8，汽油回落百分之2.6。</p><p></p><p>分析指，當地通脹仍高於央行百分之2的目標，支持央行今年內加息，以壓抑通脹。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:55:06.256308+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T19:18:20.882573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:49:21.038026+00:00","content_hash":"8e42213fde14f33f31d4550b3e510289f19d73475f9fb6576c5b469524ca8475","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:55:06.256308+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}